# After drawing the world at 1/4 scale: near trail, far south wall, close-up wall, iso view
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
wait 1.4
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
press down
press right
press right
wait 2.5
shot scale_south
# Iso: should look as before
press down
wait 1
shot scale_iso
